# Backend Rules

## Layout

- App entry: `backend/app/main.py`
- Models (source of truth): `backend/app/models/`
- Agent graph: `backend/app/agent/`
- Migrations: `backend/alembic/versions/`

## Database

- PostgreSQL schemas: `public` (OLTP), `dwh`, `ml`, `pgvector`
- Schema changes: new Alembic migration only — never edit applied migrations
- ORM models in `backend/app/models/` are canonical ([ADR-007](../../docs/decisions/0007-sqlalchemy-alembic.md))

## Agent

- LangGraph ReAct loop with tool error handling — see [LangGraphAgent.md](../../docs/10-References/LangGraphAgent.md)
- ML predictions: read from `ml` schema; LLM explains, does not invent probabilities ([ADR-006](../../docs/decisions/0006-ml-agent-boundary.md))
- Observability: propagate `trace_id`, `session_id` per [observability contract](../../docs/19-User-Behavior-Observability/README.md)

## Verify

```powershell
cd backend
ruff check .
pytest -v
```

Docker:

```powershell
docker compose exec backend pytest
docker compose exec backend alembic current
```

## Academic tree

`Department -> Program -> Specialization -> Course`. Read [H45-Plan.md](../../docs/07-Sprint-Planning/H45-Plan.md) and [ADR-008](../../docs/decisions/0008-academic-tree.md) before changing tree APIs.
